1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:02,960
Every big journey begins
with one small step.

2
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:05,270
You do not need to have
everything figured out today.

3
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:06,920
You only need to begin.

4
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,820
Think about a runner
training for a marathon.

5
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:11,470
On the first day, they
cannot run 40 kilometers.

6
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:13,910
But they put on their shoes
and run around the block.

7
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:16,020
The next week, they run a little further.

8
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:17,840
Progress is quiet and slow.

9
00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:19,650
And most days, nobody notices it.

10
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:22,000
Then one day, they cross the finish line.

11
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:23,550
Your goals work the same way.

12
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:24,860
Write one page.

13
00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:26,340
Learn one new word.

14
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:27,840
Save one coin.

15
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:32,710
Small actions repeated every day
build a life you can be proud of.

16
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:36,980
So close your eyes, take a deep
breath and take your first step today.
